---
description: >-
  Verifies that when an outer subgraph is marked collapsed (outer@{ view:
  collapsed }), its nested child subgraph (Inner, containing A --> B) collapses
  along with it into the single outermost collapsed ancestor node, rather than
  the inner subgraph remaining separately visible.
---
flowchart TD
  Start --> inner
  subgraph outer [Outer]
    subgraph inner [Inner]
      A --> B
    end
  end
  outer@{ view: collapsed }
